WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.800
Two bombs are lit beside Ryu after the target knockdown.

2
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:01.550
Ryu guards the medium target sequence.

3
00:00:01.550 --> 00:00:02.350
Light Vagabond Edge follows the target.

4
00:00:02.350 --> 00:00:02.750
Back heavy kick connects between the automatic bomb hits.

5
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:03.400
The existing second bomb launches Ryu.

6
00:00:03.400 --> 00:00:04.600
Sprint launcher extends the bomb juggle.

7
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:06.300
OD air grab catches the launch.

8
00:00:06.300 --> 00:00:07.500
Another Sprint launcher extends the rebound.

9
00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:08.650
Heavy bomb plant uses the last spray can.
